# Master of Barbs asks for noncombat damage dealt to an opponent. Three things that are not: in turn 2 Bot2 bolts Bot1 (damage to
# Master's own controller), in turn 3 Bot1 bolts Bot2's Ornithopter (noncombat damage to a creature, not a player), and then Master
# of Barbs attacks Bot2 unblocked (combat damage to an opponent, 2). Master is a 2/1 throughout, until the turn is over
# and Bot2 is at 18 from combat alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Master of Barbs
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Forest x14

